{
  "_comment": "Hearthworks skin id -> Source model + the Source sequences baked into each gameplay clip. A clip is a sequence name ({seq}), an activity regex ({act}) or a name regex ({match}); a list is tried in order; 'trim' keeps source frames [first,last]; 'fps' overrides the sequence rate; 'pose' picks the blend cell of 9-way movement blends (HL2 move_yaw 0 = forward; TF2 move_x 1 = forward). 'extraModels' adds animation files of the same ValveBiped rig family to the virtual model so their sequences can be named (bones are matched by name). HL2 NPC models have no authored death animation: 'cit_door' frames 12-52 (the male citizen set's knock-down) is borrowed for every skin that has one.",
